1
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,200
The hospital called.

2
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:49,879
Captain Bai.

3
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:53,159
Xu Duoduo just succumbed to his injuries.

4
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,359
And about him being wiretapped,

5
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,599
Li Qiang probably found out.

6
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,519
How did you confirm that?

7
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,760
I asked him if he had anything to tell me,

8
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,000
and he only mentioned Tian Xin.

9
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,120
Understood.

10
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,159
Xu Duoduo succumbed to his injuries.

11
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:09,319
Also, he only mentioned Tian Xin before he died.

12
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:10,639
Tian Xin?

13
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,639
The woman wiretapping with Li Xiao.

14
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,560
By the way,

15
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:20,120
Li Xiao mentioned that Tian Xin's father

16
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:21,960
was an old comrade of yours,

17
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,039
named Tian Zheng.

18
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:23,840
What a coincidence.

19
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,319
Before Xu Duoduo died,

20
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,680
why would he mention Tian Xin?

21
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,439
I'm not quite sure.

22
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:37,039
But based on what we've gathered,

23
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:39,599
Xu Duoduo likely had a crush on her.

24
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,759
I see.

25
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,400
Send officers to Xu Duoduo's house immediately.

26
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,400
Search it thoroughly.

27
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:47,199
See if we can find any clues.

28
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:47,599
Yes, sir.

29
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,360
Send me Tian Xin's address later.

30
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:56,080
I'd like to meet my old comrade's daughter, too.

31
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,360
It's been over ten years.

32
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:26,759
Stop!

33
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,439
Out of the way!

34
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,439
Stop! Don't run!

35
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,800
Freeze! Don't run!

36
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:32,960
Don't run! Freeze!

37
00:03:35,919 --> 00:03:36,439
Let go of me!

38
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,199
What are you doing?

39
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:53,879
You're back.

40
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:59,919
According to Qian Feng's two mistresses,

41
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,599
especially Gao Min's confession,

42
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,120
every weekend, Qian Feng

43
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:05,000
has something very important to handle.

44
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,280
We previously suspected

45
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,719
that on weekends, Qian Feng

46
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:09,159
was making deals with drug traffickers.

47
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:12,439
But Qian Feng's cash withdrawals through Li Xia

48
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:13,479
were usually on Tuesdays.

49
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:15,919
If that money

50
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:17,399
was used to pay his Supplier,

51
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,360
I don't think it makes sense

52
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,399
that he would wait until the weekend to pay.

53
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,360
The leads you just mentioned—

54
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,879
Ge Dan already found them.

55
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,160
Anything else?

56
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:31,839
On the Alipay account Qian Feng registered under Li Xia,

57
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,199
besides receiving drug money and withdrawing cash,

58
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:36,199
there are plenty of records for daily expenses.

59
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:38,279
For example, purchases at supermarkets

60
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,519
and online shopping transactions.

61
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,959
Most importantly,

62
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:43,439
Qian Feng repeatedly bought elementary school

63
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:47,160
tutoring materials and Barbie dolls.

64
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,480
Elementary school tutoring materials?

65
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,759
Barbie dolls?

66
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,680
Qian Feng's...

67
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,240
daughter.

68
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:03,680
Is there a shipping address for his online orders?

69
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,639
No. 356 Lang Street, Yangchuan City.

70
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,240
The recipient is Qian Shu.

71
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,639
One call to the Yangchuan Household Registry,

72
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:15,199
and we can verify Qian Feng and his family.

73
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:17,160
Like I need you to tell me? I checked already.

74
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,720
Qian Feng, a native of Hubei.

75
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,800
Went to college in Yangchuan.

76
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,120
After graduating, he was a buyer at the First Auto Works

77
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,879
for nearly 20 years.

78
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,600
Five years ago, he went into business.

79
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,920
His ex-wife, Li Liping, is a kindergarten teacher.

80
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,879
They divorced three years ago.

81
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,439
Custody was granted to Li Liping.

82
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,759
By court ruling,

83
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:35,240
Qian Feng only has visitation rights on weekends and holidays.

84
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:36,759
So, what do you think?

85
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,279
The day after tomorrow is the weekend.

86
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,439
I think right now,

87
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:40,879
we should book tickets to Yangchuan

88
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:42,000
and bring Qian Feng in.

89
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:45,480
Captain Lu even told me to go rest.

90
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,319
I told you, without me,

91
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,959
could our narcotics team even function?

92
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:52,079
Keeping someone like you in the narcotics unit

93
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,560
is truly a waste of your talents.

94
00:05:54,279 --> 00:05:55,480
You ought to be at the UN.

95
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,759
No, no.

96
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,319
Captain Lu, I'm doing fine right here.

97
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,480
I'm a man of loyalty.

98
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,360
What's up? Working hard, huh?

99
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,839
Been playing with jigsaw puzzles here all day.

100
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:07,560
No, not at all.

101
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,240
Zhuang Yan begged me,

102
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:11,279
begged me to sort these things out.

103
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,279
If it weren't for him,

104
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:13,560
I'd definitely follow your orders

105
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,040
and go home to get some proper rest.

106
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,959
Having you follow up on Qian Feng's case

107
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:20,279
was Captain Lu's call.

108
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,759
You still want to rest?

109
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:25,920
Forget about it.

110
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:28,040
First thing tomorrow morning, the three of you go to Yangchuan.

111
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,600
I've already coordinated with the Yangchuan police.

112
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,519
They'll assist you.

113
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,839
On this trip, make sure you bring Qian Feng back.

114
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,000
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

115
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:46,319
Let's go.

116
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,759
The boss is already waiting downstairs.

117
00:07:06,199 --> 00:07:06,839
Where are we going?

118
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,439
Kai.

119
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,279
You've seen all my venues lately,

120
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,399
big and small, right?

121
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:14,879
What do you think?

122
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:24,480
The underworld is chaotic these days.

123
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,680
Too many people don't respect the rules.

124
00:07:28,399 --> 00:07:30,360
We need to beef up our firepower.

125
00:07:32,199 --> 00:07:33,560
Boss had me source a cache of weapons.

126
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,800
We're making the deal tonight.

127
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:36,959
Are they reliable?

128
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,000
What's their background?

129
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,319
How would I know?

130
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,800
It's my first time dealing with them.

131
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,240
Don't worry, Kai.

132
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:46,959
In a bit, the two of us will go in first.

133
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,439
You two wait outside.

134
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:50,879
Once we see the goods,

135
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:51,839
bring the cash inside.

136
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:58,439
Let's go.

137
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:09,160
Then we interrogate Mu Qing first thing tomorrow.

138
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,439
Only by finding Li Qiang

139
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,759
can we possibly track down Ma Jingrong.

140
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:19,240
Drug syndicates like these

141
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,800
are always intricately connected.

142
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,439
Maybe we can

143
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:24,959
look into the logistics group's drug case

144
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,279
to dig up more leads.

145
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:37,960
Liang Wenbiao is buying guns from traffickers tonight.

146
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,759
If he's buying guns now,

147
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,279
it means he'll make his move soon.

148
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:51,799
We can't touch Liang Wenbiao.

149
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:55,039
Alert the criminal investigation team.

150
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,720
Once tonight's deal goes down,

151
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:58,840
have them bust the gun traffickers.

152
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,320
I'll send the time and location separately.

153
00:09:05,879 --> 00:09:07,080
This intel of yours...

154
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,000
You know how it is.

155
00:09:45,919 --> 00:09:46,399
What do you want?

156
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,200
Flying Fish sent us.

157
00:09:49,679 --> 00:09:50,639
It's all cleared with your boss.

158
00:09:51,679 --> 00:09:52,519
We've been waiting forever.

159
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:53,559
Come on in.

160
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:58,720
Wait for my call.

161
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:30,840
Any takers?

162
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,679
Boss, they're here.

163
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:34,879
What took you so long?

164
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,840
Don't you have any sense of time?

165
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:39,200
Traffic, Uncle Bird.

166
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:40,759
Double Jokers!

167
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:42,200
I'm out!

168
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:43,720
Boss, what kind of hand is that?

169
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,639
That's insane.

170
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:45,720
Come on, pay up, pay up!

171
00:10:45,879 --> 00:10:47,679
Boss, three double Jokers in a row?

172
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,120
Did you rig the deal?

173
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,080
Rig my ass!

174
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,960
You lost, so pay up and own it!

175
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:52,360
Hurry up.

176
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,200
Since Uncle Bird is so busy,

177
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,080
we can make the deal another day.

178
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:57,759
Let's go.

179
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:02,519
What's your connection to Flying Fish?

180
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,799
He's just one of my lackeys.

181
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,679
Tell me something useful.

182
00:11:28,159 --> 00:11:29,759
He gets his supply from me.

183
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:34,559
I just wanted to see if you're in the game.

184
00:11:36,039 --> 00:11:38,559
Ever since I watched Infernal Affairs,

185
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:43,000
everyone looks like an undercover cop to me.

186
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,519
Can't be too careful.

187
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:52,440
You're wise to be cautious, Uncle Bird.

188
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:54,960
Then again,

189
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,000
cops

190
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,600
don't usually carry stuff like this.

191
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,480
I don't use this.

192
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,240
It's bad for the brain.

193
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:20,679
Where's the money?

194
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,000
I brought it.

195
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:25,200
But I want to see the goods first.

196
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,639
Take a look.

197
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:06,279
All brought in from the outside.

198
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:09,080
Good stuff.

199
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:29,519
Pretty slick.

200
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:31,879
You flatter me.

201
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:37,919
A real talent.

202
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:43,600
Where's the money?

203
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,440
Bring the money in.

204
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:58,399
Got it.

205
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:15,559
Boss

206
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,279
We're all settled.

207
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,120
Until next time.

208
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,799
I won't see you out.

209
00:15:24,879 --> 00:15:25,399
My apologies.

210
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:27,159
Really, sorry.

211
00:15:28,919 --> 00:15:32,279
Things are too hot lately. Can't be too careful.

212
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,399
Even if you are cops,

213
00:15:34,399 --> 00:15:35,639
at least you'll die for a noble cause.

214
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:38,240
The three of you...

215
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,320
have found a decent resting place.

216
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,519
What's that saying again?

217
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,679
Something about...

218
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:46,799
getting a monument and dying a hero.

219
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:49,080
You have a death wish?

220
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,600
Who are you cussing at?

221
00:16:00,799 --> 00:16:01,720
Do you like money?

222
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,120
Let me go,

223
00:16:03,519 --> 00:16:04,519
and the cash is all yours.

224
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,600
Yeah, yeah, alright.

225
00:16:06,639 --> 00:16:07,840
Cut the bullshit.

226
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:10,320
I take what I'm owed.

227
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:12,600
What isn't mine, I won't touch a dime of it.

228
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,320
The thing is, I'm out of the game.

229
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:18,080
Why the hell are you bringing me cash?

230
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:23,159
I just don't want the gunshots drawing the cops.

231
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,000
Who were you cussing at just now?

232
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:28,159
Think I won't shoot you dead?

233
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:34,600
Move in!

234
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:03,840
Nobody move!

235
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:08,119
Dana, grab the money!

236
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:12,559
Move!

237
00:17:15,759 --> 00:17:16,160
Move!

238
00:17:17,319 --> 00:17:17,920
Go!

239
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:26,359
Yang Wei!

240
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,559
Yang Wei!

241
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:34,400
Drive!

242
00:18:19,839 --> 00:18:21,039
Mr. Jiang, he's here.

243
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,559
Hello, Mr. Jiang.

244
00:18:29,359 --> 00:18:31,279
This is Mr. Ma from the mainland.

245
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,759
Hello, Mr. Ma.

246
00:18:33,799 --> 00:18:35,200
Hello, Mr. Jiang. Pleased to meet you.

247
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,799
Please, have a seat.

248
00:18:37,799 --> 00:18:38,720
Come, please.

249
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,759
I've already prepared the tea for you.

250
00:18:47,119 --> 00:18:48,039
Come, try some.

251
00:18:48,599 --> 00:18:49,000
All right.

252
00:18:58,599 --> 00:19:01,119
The locals here love iced tea.

253
00:19:01,359 --> 00:19:02,759
I've been here for over a decade,

254
00:19:03,079 --> 00:19:04,200
and I've picked up the habit, too.

255
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:05,319
I wonder...

256
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:08,240
if it suits your taste.

257
00:19:10,279 --> 00:19:11,559
Your iced tea, Mr. Jiang,

258
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:14,480
is made from only the finest ingredients.

259
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:16,240
Naturally, it tastes great.

260
00:19:23,119 --> 00:19:25,759
Doing business is just like drinking tea.

261
00:19:26,799 --> 00:19:27,759
If you pick the right tea leaves,

262
00:19:28,079 --> 00:19:30,359
it always hits the spot.

263
00:19:31,559 --> 00:19:33,680
There are several drug lords here in Jiechan State.

264
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:36,839
I believe you know that well, Mr. Ma.

265
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,960
And you should also understand

266
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:40,920
that Mr. Tilade

267
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,720
doesn't want to see our chosen partner

268
00:19:46,519 --> 00:19:47,640
doing any business

269
00:19:48,839 --> 00:19:50,160
with other drug lords.

270
00:19:57,359 --> 00:19:59,960
Lately, there's a newcomer on the street

271
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,000
named Xiang Dong,

272
00:20:01,640 --> 00:20:02,680
nicknamed Piyazi.

273
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:06,720
I heard you've been quite close with him, Mr. Ma.

274
00:20:10,319 --> 00:20:12,559
I understand your point, Mr. Jiang.

275
00:20:13,119 --> 00:20:16,240
Since I've chosen to do business with Mr. Tilade,

276
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,920
I can assure you right now

277
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:23,519
that my people will act quickly

278
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,599
to cut ties with Piyazi once and for all.

279
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,079
But I've heard Piyazi

280
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,440
is ruthless,

281
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,720
just like a mad dog.

282
00:20:34,279 --> 00:20:36,279
Aren't you afraid that working with us

283
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,799
might bring fatal trouble upon yourself?

284
00:20:39,559 --> 00:20:42,000
Since I'm in this line of business,

285
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,400
I'm not scared of any mad dog.

286
00:20:46,119 --> 00:20:47,440
Rest assured, Mr. Jiang.

287
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:51,680
I'll take care of Piyazi as soon as possible.

288
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:58,720
Since you're so determined, Mr. Ma,

289
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:03,519
let's play big then.

290
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,759
You must know better than I do, Mr. Ma,

291
00:21:14,759 --> 00:21:15,799
that in our line of work,

292
00:21:16,039 --> 00:21:18,640
the risk is the same whether you go big or small.

293
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:22,599
Since we've decided to work together long-term,

294
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:26,359
why bother testing each other? Right?

295
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:28,640
It's pointless.

296
00:21:32,079 --> 00:21:33,200
For the first deal,

297
00:21:36,039 --> 00:21:37,799
I'll give you 50 kilos, Mr. Ma.

298
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,720
I wonder if you have the appetite

299
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,920
to swallow that much.

300
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,000
With my current distribution channels,

301
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,559
in two weeks,

302
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:50,480
I'll come see you with the cash, Mr. Jiang.

303
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:51,720
One week.

304
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:56,720
Whether we can collaborate long-term

305
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,079
depends on how cleanly

306
00:21:59,079 --> 00:22:00,279
you handle this deal, Mr. Ma.

307
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:05,440
Since you think so highly of me, Mr. Jiang,

308
00:22:07,559 --> 00:22:09,640
we'll do it your way.

309
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:24,319
Someone will take the goods to meet Mr. Ma tomorrow.

310
00:22:24,839 --> 00:22:26,400
I hope that in a week,

311
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:30,400
I will see Mr. Ma right here with the cash,

312
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,640
meeting with me.

313
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:37,319
Besides, this was decided rather quickly,

314
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:41,400
so I imagine Mr. Ma

315
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,200
hasn't had time to make arrangements for his wife.

316
00:22:44,559 --> 00:22:45,319
How about this?

317
00:22:47,119 --> 00:22:49,839
Let your wife stay with me for the time being.

318
00:22:50,359 --> 00:22:51,680
I will have someone

319
00:22:51,839 --> 00:22:54,319
take good care of her for you.

320
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:55,519
How does that sound?

321
00:23:00,559 --> 00:23:01,200
I know

322
00:23:03,039 --> 00:23:05,920
not many people get to meet Mr. Jiang.

323
00:23:07,319 --> 00:23:10,000
But no matter what,

324
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:13,799
I won't let my wife, because of me,

325
00:23:13,799 --> 00:23:15,440
risk her life.

326
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:17,920
Goodbye.

327
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:24,160
Then it's farewell for good.

328
00:23:31,599 --> 00:23:32,519
What's that supposed to mean?

329
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,039
Mr. Ma,

330
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:37,000
we're both in this line of work.

331
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:39,160
You should know better than anyone:

332
00:23:41,519 --> 00:23:42,960
once you step onto this ship,

333
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,720
you can't just get off

334
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:46,799
whenever you feel like it.

335
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:49,480
Mr. Tilade thinks very highly of you, Mr. Ma.

336
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:52,200
But I still need to see

337
00:23:53,079 --> 00:23:54,640
your capability and your sincerity.

338
00:24:03,759 --> 00:24:05,319
This is my first time in Country M.

339
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,880
I'd actually love to stay and look around for a few days.

340
00:24:22,839 --> 00:24:23,519
In one week,

341
00:24:25,559 --> 00:24:26,759
I'll bring the money to meet you.

342
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:30,400
We have a deal, Mr. Jiang.

343
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:34,400
If my wife

344
00:24:35,519 --> 00:24:37,319
suffers the slightest harm,

345
00:24:37,359 --> 00:24:39,480
I won't let this go easily.

346
00:24:50,319 --> 00:24:50,960
I'll take my leave.

347
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,759
Five-star hotels really are something else.

348
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:49,519
We can even watch TV from back home.

349
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:51,920
Just a few lousy channels. What's so good about that?

350
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:53,400
We've been in Country M for so long,

351
00:25:53,559 --> 00:25:55,079
but the boss hasn't even taken us out for fun.

352
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:57,319
Tell me about it.

353
00:26:00,599 --> 00:26:01,359
Boss is back.

354
00:26:04,559 --> 00:26:05,039
Boss. Boss.

355
00:26:21,759 --> 00:26:22,640
Boss, what's the deal here?

356
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,480
We thought our trip to Country M

357
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,559
would go smoothly,

358
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:29,200
but who knew Jiang Liye

359
00:26:29,200 --> 00:26:30,559
would use your wife to threaten you!

360
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:34,240
Mr. Qin.

361
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:35,799
Doesn't this Jiang Liye

362
00:26:35,799 --> 00:26:37,319
work for Mr. Tilade?

363
00:26:37,359 --> 00:26:37,680
Why is it that

364
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,240
we passed Mr. Tilade's test,

365
00:26:39,359 --> 00:26:40,480
yet he's pulling this stunt now?

366
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,640
Tilade and Jiang Liye...

367
00:26:43,799 --> 00:26:45,079
One's just playing good cop,

368
00:26:45,079 --> 00:26:46,279
and the other's playing bad cop.

369
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:47,960
In my view, if things

370
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,599
had gone too smoothly,

371
00:26:49,720 --> 00:26:51,880
it wouldn't be a good sign for us.

372
00:26:53,839 --> 00:26:55,240
Though things look bad right now,

373
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,680
it just proves

374
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:58,079
Tilade really wants us

375
00:26:58,359 --> 00:26:59,559
to move goods into the mainland for him.

376
00:27:00,519 --> 00:27:02,240
The only reason Jiang Liye kept Miss Li

377
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:02,880
behind this time

378
00:27:03,079 --> 00:27:05,839
is that he still doesn't trust us.

379
00:27:07,519 --> 00:27:08,880
He won't lay a finger on Miss Li.

380
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:09,960
I'm certain of that.

381
00:27:10,319 --> 00:27:10,799
Still,

382
00:27:12,079 --> 00:27:13,279
our major buyers

383
00:27:13,279 --> 00:27:14,599
have been very cautious lately.

384
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:17,400
Even if someone takes this much stock at once,

385
00:27:17,599 --> 00:27:19,000
the timeline is extremely tight.

386
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:22,960
I have plans for the buyers.

387
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:25,920
Lao Qin,

388
00:27:26,319 --> 00:27:27,440
once we get the goods tomorrow,

389
00:27:27,839 --> 00:27:29,119
arrange for Yunfei and me to leave the country.

390
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:31,400
Now, continuing our news coverage.

391
00:27:31,640 --> 00:27:34,200
Yesterday, Nanhai police launched a special anti-drug raid,

392
00:27:34,519 --> 00:27:36,960
cracking a major drug trafficking case.

393
00:27:37,559 --> 00:27:40,119
Chief suspect Mu Qing and his accomplices,

394
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:42,160
Wang Sanyang, He Xiangrong, and others,

395
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:44,000
have been arrested by the police.

396
00:27:44,559 --> 00:27:45,960
Another suspect, Li Qiang,

397
00:27:45,960 --> 00:27:47,240
is currently wanted by the police.

398
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:48,359
In this operation,

399
00:27:48,359 --> 00:27:50,880
two million yuan in illicit drug money

400
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,319
and five kilograms of narcotics were seized.

401
00:27:52,839 --> 00:27:55,039
It is the largest drug case

402
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:56,240
cracked in Nanhai in the past two years.

403
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:59,400
No wonder I couldn't reach Brother Qiang yesterday.

404
00:28:00,759 --> 00:28:01,400
Boss,

405
00:28:02,039 --> 00:28:02,960
with such a huge mess,

406
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,359
why didn't Brother Qiang

407
00:28:04,359 --> 00:28:05,400
give us a call?

408
00:28:10,119 --> 00:28:10,920
What do we do now?

409
00:28:13,039 --> 00:28:13,960
We can't stay in Nanhai.

410
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:17,920
Contact Ah Qiang.

411
00:28:18,559 --> 00:28:20,400
Tell him to offload his stock as soon as possible,

412
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:21,759
and then head to Country M.

413
00:28:21,759 --> 00:28:23,240
Next, we will broadcast again

414
00:28:23,359 --> 00:28:24,920
the suspect information released by the police.

415
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,799
Li Qiang, 35 years old.

416
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,359
Height: 1.78 meters.

417
00:28:28,559 --> 00:28:30,880
Weight: approx. 70 kilograms, athletic build.

418
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,079
Mai Wendi, 28 years old.

419
00:28:33,599 --> 00:28:34,960
Height: approx. 1.78 meters.

420
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:37,839
Weight: approx. 65 kilograms, slim build.

421
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:39,400
If members of the public spot

422
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:41,000
anyone matching these descriptions,

423
00:28:41,119 --> 00:28:42,799
please notify the police immediately.

424
00:28:43,039 --> 00:28:45,599
Didn't you say you'd play a few rounds with me?

425
00:28:45,839 --> 00:28:47,160
How did you end up on TV so soon?

426
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,119
Come on, have a drink.

427
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:57,319
Speak.

428
00:28:57,599 --> 00:28:58,759
The boss called.

429
00:28:59,559 --> 00:29:01,440
Asking when we'll deal with Qian.

430
00:29:02,079 --> 00:29:04,319
Don't you have plenty of men under you?

431
00:29:04,799 --> 00:29:06,440
Why dump this job on me?

432
00:29:06,759 --> 00:29:07,960
It's the boss's orders.

433
00:29:08,519 --> 00:29:10,400
The boss knows you botched it last time,

434
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:13,839
so you'd better take care of it fast.

435
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:16,359
You think I don't want to wrap this up quickly?

436
00:29:17,039 --> 00:29:19,000
Why do you educated folks

437
00:29:19,319 --> 00:29:21,039
always love beating around the bush?

438
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:22,759
Fine, fine.

439
00:29:23,039 --> 00:29:24,480
Give me two days. Wait for my call.

440
00:29:30,599 --> 00:29:30,920
Ah Li.

441
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:33,240
Brother Four.

442
00:29:35,119 --> 00:29:36,039
Get in touch with Guangzai.

443
00:29:36,319 --> 00:29:37,160
See where he is.

444
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,359
Got it, Brother Four.

445
00:29:47,759 --> 00:29:49,799
Your subordinate provided this list.

446
00:29:50,319 --> 00:29:52,640
He already confessed to all your crimes.

447
00:29:53,559 --> 00:29:55,319
Since you already know everything,

448
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:56,319
why bother asking me?

449
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:58,319
We need you to confirm if anything was missed.

450
00:30:04,079 --> 00:30:05,960
My subordinate confessed to everything.

451
00:30:06,119 --> 00:30:08,720
That counts as cooperating.

452
00:30:09,119 --> 00:30:10,519
I hope the judge will go easy on him.

453
00:30:11,039 --> 00:30:11,759
As for me...

454
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,759
Sentence me however you see fit.

455
00:30:15,359 --> 00:30:16,480
I'll plead guilty and accept the punishment.

456
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:22,359
The people on this list

457
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:25,079
are only some of the ones you dealt with.

458
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:29,440
The bosses behind them...

459
00:30:30,079 --> 00:30:31,440
you should know them better than anyone.

460
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:36,680
I know what's on your mind.

461
00:30:37,119 --> 00:30:39,079
You know you've committed a serious crime,

462
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:41,160
and there's no chance of sentence reduction.

463
00:30:41,319 --> 00:30:44,559
So you choose to protect

464
00:30:44,559 --> 00:30:45,880
the people who once helped you.

465
00:30:46,079 --> 00:30:48,400
But I hope you think it through carefully.

466
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:50,480
Reaching this point today...

467
00:30:50,799 --> 00:30:52,680
Did those people who once helped you

468
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,640
really help you,

469
00:30:56,039 --> 00:30:57,480
or did they actually ruin you?

470
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:02,039
The officer who questioned you earlier told me

471
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:03,359
you said you wanted

472
00:31:04,079 --> 00:31:06,079
to enjoy whatever time you have left.

473
00:31:07,079 --> 00:31:09,079
While you still have time,

474
00:31:09,079 --> 00:31:10,480
have you considered doing something meaningful?

475
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:13,160
After all this talk,

476
00:31:13,799 --> 00:31:15,079
you just want me to rat people out.

477
00:31:15,519 --> 00:31:17,599
It's a chance to make amends.

478
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:19,880
Do you know that because of you,

479
00:31:20,519 --> 00:31:22,680
countless families have been torn apart?

480
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:25,359
And how many people, because of you,

481
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,519
lost their chance at a good life?

482
00:31:28,039 --> 00:31:29,160
Don't you feel any remorse?

483
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:35,400
You think I forced them to take drugs?

484
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:36,799
To you,

485
00:31:37,079 --> 00:31:39,839
drugs are contraband, poison.

486
00:31:40,559 --> 00:31:41,720
But to me,

487
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,160
it's just business.

488
00:31:44,759 --> 00:31:46,759
They want it, I supply it.

489
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:49,119
I don't feel there's anything to regret.

490
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:53,720
There's actually one thing

491
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:55,200
I've never quite understood.

492
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:57,480
Your father

493
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,960
is a nationally renowned entrepreneur.

494
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:05,279
With everything he could give you

495
00:32:05,279 --> 00:32:06,720
and your own achievements,

496
00:32:09,319 --> 00:32:10,240
your future

497
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,799
would have been bright.

498
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:15,599
Money, social status,

499
00:32:16,319 --> 00:32:18,519
even the limelight from the media...

500
00:32:19,079 --> 00:32:21,240
things ordinary people could never dream of.

501
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:25,559
Why choose the path of drug trafficking?

502
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:26,559
Let me tell you.

503
00:32:26,559 --> 00:32:27,960
I did it purely for the thrill.

504
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:28,799
Believe it or not.

505
00:32:32,759 --> 00:32:33,839
And as for my father...

506
00:32:34,480 --> 00:32:36,599
You think he'd leave everything he has

507
00:32:36,599 --> 00:32:37,599
to me?

508
00:32:38,559 --> 00:32:40,000
My parents have two kids.

509
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:43,319
I have an older brother with a Harvard PhD.

510
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:44,759
In my father's eyes,

511
00:32:44,759 --> 00:32:47,640
I've always been the disobedient one

512
00:32:47,799 --> 00:32:49,039
who caused trouble everywhere.

513
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:51,480
Growing up,

514
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,519
my father always predicted

515
00:32:52,519 --> 00:32:54,440
that I'd end up like this.

516
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,599
My ending up like this

517
00:32:56,839 --> 00:32:59,240
was no surprise to them at all.

518
00:33:01,359 --> 00:33:04,359
They got what they wished for.

519
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:06,480
I don't believe you ended up here

520
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:08,000
just because of what your father said.

521
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,920
I'd rather believe

522
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:11,960
you wanted your father's attention,

523
00:33:14,119 --> 00:33:15,319
or even his approval.

524
00:33:19,039 --> 00:33:20,519
You just chose the wrong way.

525
00:33:21,119 --> 00:33:21,720
Whatever.

526
00:33:22,599 --> 00:33:23,759
I've had my fun.

527
00:33:24,319 --> 00:33:24,839
It was worth it.

528
00:33:31,960 --> 00:33:33,400
Before I came here today,

529
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:36,000
I had my officers contact your parents.

530
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,759
I wanted them to talk you into cooperating.

531
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,799
But they can't make it now.

532
00:33:42,319 --> 00:33:43,799
Of course they wouldn't come.

533
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:46,839
I'm sure my father has already drafted a statement,

534
00:33:47,240 --> 00:33:49,200
ready to announce to all the media

535
00:33:49,599 --> 00:33:51,759
that he's disowning me.

536
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:56,079
We got word from your mother.

537
00:33:56,279 --> 00:33:57,079
Your father...

538
00:33:58,799 --> 00:34:00,759
after seeing the news reports about you,

539
00:34:01,119 --> 00:34:03,240
had a sudden cerebral hemorrhage and was hospitalized.

540
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:08,119
What did you say?

541
00:34:09,239 --> 00:34:10,039
He was hospitalized?

542
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:12,000
How is he doing now?

543
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:14,599
Half an hour ago...

544
00:34:17,079 --> 00:34:17,719
he passed away.

545
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:18,960
That's impossible.

546
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:21,840
You're lying to me.

547
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:22,840
You're lying to me, aren't you?

548
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,639
You're lying to me, aren't you?!

549
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:26,559
He's always been healthy.

550
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:27,880
Nothing could happen to him!

551
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:30,440
He's always been in good health!

552
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:33,559
You're just lying to me.

553
00:34:33,599 --> 00:34:35,400
You're just lying to me, aren't you?!

554
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:38,199
Tell me you're lying to me.

555
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,599
Just tell me that you're lying,

556
00:34:39,599 --> 00:34:41,079
and I'll tell you everything!

557
00:34:41,599 --> 00:34:42,920
You know I wouldn't lie to you.

558
00:34:43,079 --> 00:34:44,519
Now you should realize

559
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:46,000
in your father's heart...

560
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:48,559
just how much you truly mattered.

561
00:35:14,239 --> 00:35:16,239
According to Mu Qing and Li Yawei's statements,

562
00:35:16,519 --> 00:35:18,000
before coming to Nanhai,

563
00:35:18,159 --> 00:35:19,320
Mu Qing had contacted someone

564
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:20,679
nicknamed Four-Legged Snake.

565
00:35:21,199 --> 00:35:23,039
They had already reached a deal,

566
00:35:23,199 --> 00:35:24,360
but Four-Legged Snake's shipment

567
00:35:24,559 --> 00:35:25,639
suddenly ran into an issue,

568
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:27,360
so she contacted Li Qiang instead.

569
00:35:28,199 --> 00:35:29,119
We suspect that

570
00:35:29,400 --> 00:35:32,400
the goods Four-Legged Snake was to supply

571
00:35:32,559 --> 00:35:34,440
is what we found at the logistics company,

572
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,840
the seized No. 4 heroin.

573
00:35:36,079 --> 00:35:37,039
But all of this

574
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:38,800
requires finding Qian Feng

575
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:39,960
before it can be confirmed.

576
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,840
Sort out the suspects' interrogation records

577
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:45,800
and send them to the relevant department ASAP.

578
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:46,320
Understood.

579
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,000
Have Zhuang Yan and his team left?

580
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,800
Their bullet train was at nine this morning.

581
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:52,039
They should be arriving soon.

582
00:36:07,199 --> 00:36:07,920
Your phone.

583
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:10,480
Ex-military?

584
00:36:12,760 --> 00:36:13,719
That was ten years ago.

585
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,800
Why, did you serve too?

586
00:36:16,079 --> 00:36:16,480
No.

587
00:36:16,679 --> 00:36:18,360
I used to work in a military clinic.

588
00:36:18,639 --> 00:36:20,360
I'm used to hands that have held guns.

589
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:31,400
Yangchuan CID has sent officers to Li Liping's home

590
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,800
and to stake out near Qian Shu's school.

591
00:36:33,880 --> 00:36:34,880
As soon as Qian Feng shows up,

592
00:36:35,679 --> 00:36:36,760
they'll move in and arrest him.

593
00:36:37,679 --> 00:36:39,519
Are you sure that once he shows up,

594
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:41,559
we'll definitely get the chance to catch him?

595
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:43,280
Are you worried

596
00:36:43,559 --> 00:36:45,679
someone will help him escape again?

597
00:36:48,119 --> 00:36:49,880
I have a feeling that suspect from last time

598
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:51,400
will show up again.

599
00:36:52,199 --> 00:36:54,239
But whether he's helping Qian Feng escape

600
00:36:54,599 --> 00:36:55,519
or has another agenda,

601
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:57,840
I can't be sure right now.

602
00:36:58,400 --> 00:36:59,199
What do you mean, then?

603
00:37:02,119 --> 00:37:03,880
Ever since we started tracing Psychedelic Blues,

604
00:37:04,320 --> 00:37:05,559
every single lead we uncover

605
00:37:05,599 --> 00:37:06,719
gets deliberately cut off.

606
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:09,800
If we want to know what this suspect's

607
00:37:09,920 --> 00:37:11,360
true motive is

608
00:37:11,519 --> 00:37:13,079
for staying close to Qian Feng,

609
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:15,199
I'm afraid we'll have to catch him first.

610
00:37:17,119 --> 00:37:18,440
If that's the case,

611
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:20,159
the person pulling the suspect's strings

612
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:22,199
must be Qian Feng's accomplice,

613
00:37:22,400 --> 00:37:23,320
or his Supplier.

614
00:37:23,679 --> 00:37:24,480
Because only then

615
00:37:24,599 --> 00:37:25,599
could he stay one step ahead of us

616
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:26,800
and know Qian Feng's every move.

617
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:32,039
The suspect's sketch—

618
00:37:32,159 --> 00:37:33,039
how's it going?

619
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:39,199
I've tried many times,

620
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,239
but I'm feeling less and less certain.

621
00:37:44,159 --> 00:37:44,880
What's the issue?

622
00:37:46,199 --> 00:37:46,920
It's on me.

623
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:51,840
Do you need me, or a psychologist?

624
00:37:57,039 --> 00:37:57,599
No need.

625
00:37:58,679 --> 00:37:59,239
I'll try again.

626
00:38:01,239 --> 00:38:01,679
Let's go.

627
00:38:03,639 --> 00:38:03,840
Zhou Fuhai said...

628
00:38:03,840 --> 00:38:04,679
Zhou Fuhai said

629
00:38:04,679 --> 00:38:06,320
his company only offers door-to-door delivery

630
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,719
to contracted clients.

631
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:11,239
Yet Zhongtian's long-term contracted clients

632
00:38:11,239 --> 00:38:12,639
usually have low shipping volumes.

633
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:15,400
There are three companies like Gao Min's

634
00:38:15,599 --> 00:38:16,480
with very few orders.

635
00:38:17,119 --> 00:38:18,159
I don't think they warrant

636
00:38:18,159 --> 00:38:19,159
such priority from Zhongtian.

637
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:23,880
You suspect someone at Zhongtian

638
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:25,719
is colluding with Gao Min?

639
00:38:27,119 --> 00:38:29,159
Besides Gao Min's beauty care center,

640
00:38:29,159 --> 00:38:31,280
there's Yike Gifts and the Chaoqing Online Store.

641
00:38:31,519 --> 00:38:33,880
Could it all just be a coincidence?

642
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,159
Long-term contracts...

643
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,920
I think both of those companies are suspicious.

644
00:38:39,119 --> 00:38:40,039
Suspicious too?

645
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:43,199
Yet the one who signed contracts with these clients

646
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:44,559
was Zhou Fuhai himself.

647
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:47,480
He's Zhongtian Logistics branch's admin director.

648
00:38:47,639 --> 00:38:49,480
Besides, with so many orders,

649
00:38:49,679 --> 00:38:51,679
everyone at the logistics firm sees them.

650
00:38:52,119 --> 00:38:53,599
If they're colluding,

651
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:54,880
the risk would be far too high.

652
00:38:55,039 --> 00:38:56,000
As long as the profits are huge enough,

653
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:58,519
someone will always take the gamble.

654
00:38:59,519 --> 00:39:01,480
And if I'm not mistaken,

655
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:04,440
some higher-ups at Zhongtian Logistics

656
00:39:04,639 --> 00:39:06,119
have been compromised by the cartel

657
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:08,519
to provide transit channels for drug smuggling.

658
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:10,679
Then the cartel we're up against

659
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:11,920
has serious power behind it.

660
00:39:12,119 --> 00:39:13,000
We'll definitely win.

661
00:39:19,199 --> 00:39:20,000
Are you looking at me?

662
00:39:23,199 --> 00:39:24,079
Do you have any idea

663
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:26,840
that when you're focused on work,

664
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:28,960
you're incredibly attractive?

665
00:39:34,079 --> 00:39:34,679
Really?

666
00:39:55,719 --> 00:39:56,800
I've actually been wondering,

667
00:39:57,039 --> 00:39:58,639
what's the suspect's real motive?

668
00:40:00,679 --> 00:40:01,239
Think about it.

669
00:40:02,440 --> 00:40:04,119
When Qian Feng saw the suspect,

670
00:40:04,119 --> 00:40:05,239
he looked shocked.

671
00:40:05,239 --> 00:40:07,039
It means they didn't even know each other.

672
00:40:07,559 --> 00:40:09,559
And if the drug syndicate wanted to silence him,

673
00:40:10,199 --> 00:40:11,280
wouldn't that be easy?

674
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,000
Anyway,

675
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:14,719
once the suspect shows up again,

676
00:40:14,719 --> 00:40:16,519
the truth will finally come to light.

677
00:40:17,239 --> 00:40:18,679
But none of us have seen him.

678
00:40:18,679 --> 00:40:19,519
If he does show up,

679
00:40:19,519 --> 00:40:20,599
how will we recognize him?

680
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,000
Right.

681
00:40:23,599 --> 00:40:25,239
Hasn't Captain Bai been asking Captain Lu

682
00:40:25,440 --> 00:40:27,000
to sketch the suspect?

683
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:30,239
I heard Captain Lu was once a police sketch artist.

684
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:31,400
Is that true?

685
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:32,559
It's true.

686
00:40:33,440 --> 00:40:35,039
Though that was many years ago.

687
00:40:36,599 --> 00:40:37,559
Chief Huang told me

688
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:39,639
he was a top student at the art academy.

689
00:40:40,039 --> 00:40:41,559
Because of his talent for portrait sketching,

690
00:40:41,559 --> 00:40:42,679
he was specially recruited into the force.

691
00:40:43,119 --> 00:40:46,119
Back then, with his incredible sketches,

692
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:48,440
he cracked numerous major cases.

693
00:40:48,480 --> 00:40:50,760
He even received commendations from the Department.

694
00:40:51,079 --> 00:40:52,039
Then later on,

695
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:54,079
an accident happened,

696
00:40:54,239 --> 00:40:55,599
and he never picked up a pencil again.

697
00:40:58,079 --> 00:41:00,280
The suspect portrait Captain Lu drew back then

698
00:41:00,280 --> 00:41:02,119
wasn't the actual killer at all,

699
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:05,159
yet it happened to look just like

700
00:41:05,159 --> 00:41:07,119
an innocent bystander at the crime scene.

701
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:09,400
A witness insisted

702
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:11,639
the bystander was the killer.

703
00:41:12,039 --> 00:41:13,679
When the police moved in to arrest him,

704
00:41:14,400 --> 00:41:16,559
the bystander panicked and ran,

705
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,960
only to be hit by a car.

706
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:19,880
Dad!

707
00:41:20,159 --> 00:41:21,760
My legs!

708
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,599
Are you sure?

709
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:30,960
My legs...

710
00:41:33,599 --> 00:41:34,719
He ended up in a wheelchair for life.

711
00:41:35,119 --> 00:41:35,960
Ever since that day,

712
00:41:37,199 --> 00:41:39,559
Captain Lu never had the courage to draw again.

713
00:41:54,280 --> 00:41:55,800
But hearing all this,

714
00:41:56,559 --> 00:41:58,079
it doesn't sound like Captain Lu's fault.

715
00:41:58,639 --> 00:41:59,960
The witness probably subconsciously

716
00:41:59,960 --> 00:42:01,159
distorted their own memory.

717
00:42:01,599 --> 00:42:03,159
Memory is easily influenced by others,

718
00:42:03,519 --> 00:42:05,079
and naturally prone to idealization.

719
00:42:05,679 --> 00:42:06,480
We always unconsciously

720
00:42:06,480 --> 00:42:07,599
alter our own memories.

721
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:10,039
Just like a couple who are always late,

722
00:42:10,199 --> 00:42:11,760
each thinks the other

723
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:12,960
is late more often.

724
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:15,679
You're right.

725
00:42:17,599 --> 00:42:18,800
Captain Lu just puts

726
00:42:19,679 --> 00:42:20,800
all the blame on himself.

727
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,400
Because the sketch he drew

728
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,679
changed someone's life forever.

729
00:42:24,559 --> 00:42:25,559
When a tragedy happens,

730
00:42:26,760 --> 00:42:30,239
someone always has to take the blame.

731
00:42:34,199 --> 00:42:35,840
Height is roughly between 1.75

732
00:42:35,920 --> 00:42:37,159
and 1.80 meters.

733
00:42:37,320 --> 00:42:38,800
The chin is fairly wide,

734
00:42:39,119 --> 00:42:40,960
with eyes smaller than average,

735
00:42:41,679 --> 00:42:42,559
and a broad forehead.

736
00:42:43,840 --> 00:42:45,320
Dad, what's wrong?

737
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:47,119
My leg... Dad, get up!

738
00:42:53,280 --> 00:42:54,119
We already checked.

739
00:42:54,239 --> 00:42:56,280
Zhang Junyan was just passing by the scene.

740
00:42:56,679 --> 00:42:58,480
The witness changed their story,

741
00:42:58,480 --> 00:42:59,440
saying they misremembered.

742
00:43:06,079 --> 00:43:07,199
If I hadn't,

743
00:43:07,800 --> 00:43:10,360
while the witness was unsure,

744
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:11,679
guided their testimony,

745
00:43:14,880 --> 00:43:16,559
this tragedy wouldn't have happened.

746
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:48,639
Do you have time to step out with me?

747
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:52,800
Someone wants to see you.
